{"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.10082304814147075,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"y":0.071220930073798039,"w":0.11934155782063802},{"y":0.11918604639900054,"t":"TRUDIE:","w":0.053497943878173831,"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.10288065757908868,"c":1},{"y":0.11390435767584273,"x":0.18303768873392764,"t":"I've just had an idea. Why don't we make an in-depth study of our local public","h":0.017711683774303322,"c":1,"w":0.61746281941731773},{"t":"library as background to our paper?","y":0.13068701792894521,"h":0.017241133677524223,"c":1,"w":0.28848663330078123,"x":0.18293887409230403},{"h":0.019951895634052419,"c":1,"x":0.17478688930087372,"t":"Yes, that'd be interesting, and raise all sorts of issues. Let's make a list of possible","y":0.14318802340951708,"w":0.66283121744791662},{"h":0.018316312729259265,"w":0.65860580444335937,"t":"things we could ask about, then work out some sort of structure. For instance, um.","x":0.18302680659571499,"c":1,"y":0.15921323402568288},{"y":0.1754477496820489,"c":1,"x":0.18510249054878072,"t":"we could interview some of the staff, and find out whether the library has its own","w":0.64005640665690111,"h":0.016482482388949116},{"c":1,"y":0.19204992363955653,"h":0.015970918680108026,"w":0.38906847635904951,"t":"budget, or if that's controlled by the local council.","x":0.18506646846939911},{"h":0.01611079428305473,"w":0.62364812215169274,"x":0.18715160993710167,"y":0.2061327320384414,"t":"And what their policies are. I know they don't allow food, but I'd love to find out","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"what types of noise they ban - there always seems to be a lot of talking, but never","x":0.18715694384996689,"w":0.65243631998697915,"h":0.015853957096454763,"y":0.22180712571704919},{"c":1,"x":0.18518518733908926,"t":"music. I don't know if that's a policy or it just happens.","y":0.2396937574082143,"w":0.43004114786783854,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"h":0.0200194604826478,"y":0.25113258560686424,"x":0.1027005012300692,"c":1,"t":"STEWART: Ah, I've often wondered. Then there are things like how the library is affected by","w":0.71843282063802083},{"w":0.66070917765299486,"h":0.01881012169576235,"x":0.18505879249800841,"y":0.26734586921515402,"c":1,"t":"employment laws. I suppose there are rules about working hours, facilities for staff,"},{"c":1,"w":0.086849835713704415,"t":"and so on.","x":0.1870645547129085,"h":0.011524371179731263,"y":0.28760746764034661},{"y":0.30523255804501581,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"TRUDIE:","w":0.055555553436279298,"x":0.10493827256169572},{"t":"Right. Then there are other issues relating to the design of the building and how","y":0.29764656667334066,"w":0.63609619140624996,"x":0.18707416742263736,"h":0.019405088660573777,"c":1},{"y":0.31389635710016905,"w":0.6525337727864583,"t":"customers use it. Like what measures does the library take to ensure their safety?","x":0.18506300492309188,"h":0.018437227175008286,"c":1},{"y":0.32922695794182322,"w":0.65863332112630213,"x":0.18713042961909424,"h":0.019280612258102292,"c":1,"t":"They'd need floor coverings that aren't slippery, and emergency exits, for instance."},{"c":1,"t":"Oh, and another thing - there's the question of the kind of insurance the library","h":0.019320319482378778,"w":0.62780207316080727,"y":0.34421361589316191,"x":0.18712724631885722},{"t":"needs to have. in case anyone gets injured","c":1,"y":0.36156799918054205,"h":0.016990266222554951,"x":0.18704600679814443,"w":0.34401987711588544},{"t":"STEWART:","y":0.3821870301183139,"w":0.067942263285319007,"h":0.0088817536901106831,"x":0.10697537030879388,"c":1},{"y":0.39680232545457661,"t":"TRUDIE:","x":0.10699588405085364,"w":0.053497943878173831,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"y":0.41279069758283593,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"STEWART:","w":0.069958845774332687,"c":1,"x":0.10699588564881073},{"t":"Yes, that's something else to find out. You know something I've often wondered?","x":0.18507464695506087,"y":0.37414781952725085,"w":0.64224792480468751,"h":0.020026349628210371,"c":1},{"x":0.1871664261468404,"w":0.10303340276082354,"h":0.013694760375365433,"c":1,"t":"What's that?","y":0.39358866602241482},{"c":1,"y":0.40635340239331552,"w":0.66274505615234369,"x":0.18509119379648883,"h":0.019206423360691893,"t":"Well, you know they've got an archive of local newspapers going back years? Well,"},{"t":"next to it they've got the diary of a well-known politician from the late 19th century.","x":0.18716498731912243,"y":0.42235000728097272,"w":0.6503517659505208,"h":0.017037685964919058,"c":1},{"t":"I wonder why it's there. Do you know what his connection was with this area?","x":0.18705927939639566,"y":0.43608245465994744,"w":0.615584462483724,"c":1,"h":0.019759184901368854},{"t":"TRUDIE:","y":0.45930232547179606,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.10493827118809075,"w":0.057613169352213542},{"w":0.70781890869140629,"h":0.016002068109590928,"c":1,"t":"No idea. Let's add it to our list of things to find out. Oh, I've just thought - you know Q29","y":0.45347467621571558,"x":0.1872428090185512},{"x":0.18708266017996,"w":0.64846359252929686,"c":1,"h":0.01939507564189713,"t":"people might ask in the library about local organisations, like sports clubs? Well. I","y":0.46759087680390998},{"w":0.51646092732747406,"x":0.18724278775285047,"t":"wonder if they keep a database, or whether they just look online.","y":0.48546511612982002,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"w":0.07214085896809895,"t":"STEWART:","y":0.50416511504866313,"x":0.10487607268736172,"h":0.01201860699692936,"c":1},{"x":0.18922127372125014,"c":1,"t":"Right. Lquite fancy finding out what the differences are between a library that's","y":0.49913278078598866,"w":0.62565190633138013,"h":0.01706491342281713},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.86008230513029371,"c":1,"y":0.49999999986320809,"t":"Q30","h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.018724430295407268,"y":0.51393293758987346,"w":0.63401056925455723,"c":1,"x":0.18710116063421528,"t":"open to the public and one that's part of a museum, for example - they must be"},{"h":0.01463567971902402,"w":0.1116974385579427,"c":1,"y":0.5327313550025089,"t":"very different.","x":0.18701294598156995},{"t":"TRUDIE:","x":0.10493827296596533,"y":0.55087209288000383,"w":0.059670778910318995,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"w":0.38477366129557283,"y":0.54796511615522692,"x":0.19135802527477613,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. Then something else I'd like to know is ..."},{"y":0.59738372074448109,"x":0.10905350001570496,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.15432098388671878,"t":"SECTION 4"},{"w":0.72248825073242195,"x":0.10687448078704989,"y":0.62286650860487047,"c":1,"h":0.019514775809747475,"t":"In public discussion of business, we take certain values for granted. Today I'm going to talk"},{"t":"about four of them: collaboration, hard work, creativity and excellence. Most people would","x":0.10691017168815203,"y":0.63873706738037828,"h":0.017812993978583491,"c":1,"w":0.71418731689453119},{"x":0.10683430218633035,"y":0.65311798378262031,"t":"say they're all 'good things'. I'm going to suggest that's an over-simple view.","w":0.60727411905924478,"h":0.020022325998762414,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020802059780161364,"w":0.73488672892252604,"t":"The trouble with these values is that they're theoretical concepts, removed from the reality of","y":0.6762962941889531,"x":0.11098273369288904},{"h":0.019613930979662464,"c":1,"x":0.1068909439178799,"y":0.6920002634563599,"w":0.79241561889648438,"t":"day-to-day business. Pursue values by all means, but be prepared for what may happen as a Q31"},{"h":0.017554569581372137,"c":1,"t":"result. They can actually cause damage, which is not at all the intention.","x":0.10684897968448671,"y":0.7083400223520544,"w":0.5743278503417969},{"h":0.017505396381283789,"c":1,"w":0.73468429565429694,"x":0.10898626012361007,"t":"Business leaders generally try to do the right thing. But all too often the right thing backfires.","y":0.73164909264936018},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q32","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.73110465097983002,"x":0.86213991838132265,"c":1},{"t":"if those leaders adopt values without understanding and managing the side effects that arise.","y":0.74672974883850729,"x":0.10897331976257296,"w":0.74086990356445315,"h":0.016974560363553826,"c":1},{"t":"The values can easily get in the way of what's actually intended.","y":0.76295641948918602,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.10905349617906439,"c":1,"w":0.51234568277994796},{"w":0.72016459147135425,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"y":0.78621908103008586,"x":0.11111111999442073,"t":"OK. So the first value I'm going to discuss is collaboration. Er, let me give you an exampie."},{"w":0.69971481323242191,"x":0.10897076507075799,"h":0.016922091426781916,"t":"On a management training course | once attended, we were put into groups and had to.","c":1,"y":0.80171409253571246},{"x":0.86419753155004664,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"t":"Q33","y":0.80087209284029515,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"h":0.018737268391711415,"w":0.72248458862304688,"x":0.10891515768447732,"t":"construct a bridge across a stream, using building blocks that we were given. The rule was","y":0.81628603848309478},{"y":0.83118995576088195,"w":0.71211746215820315,"h":0.018107191833927505,"c":1,"x":0.11100382084825952,"t":"that everyone in the team had to move at least one building block during the construction."},{"x":0.11316872691181051,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.34362139383951823,"c":1,"y":0.85029069756399367,"t":"This was intended to encourage teamwork."},{"x":0.11111111063539482,"y":0.94331395331135748,"w":0.026748971939086916,"t":"98","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721299237268,"h":0.016454192297478354,"w":0.20824633280436194,"y":0.96768258536995222}],"w":2400}